{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"37":"Zuhd"},"section_detail":{"37":{"hadithnumber_first":4100,"hadithnumber_last":4341,"arabicnumber_first":4100,"arabicnumber_last":4341,"name_native":"Zuhd"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4157,"arabicnumber":4157,"text":"It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that they suffered from hunger and they were seven. He said:“Then the Prophet (ﷺ) gave me seven dates, one date for each man.”","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari"}],"reference":{"book":37,"hadith":58}}]}